5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg mb-6","children":"Six mobile conversion failures"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"CTA Placement"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"CTA below fold on mobile - primary action hidden, visitor does not scroll"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6 mb-3 pl-7","children":"A CTA that sits in the hero on a 1440px desktop layout frequently falls below the fold on a 390px mobile viewport. The visitor sees the headline, maybe the lede, and then a stock image or a feature row. The button is not visible. Cold paid traffic arriving from an ad does not scroll to find an action they expected to see immediately. The session ends."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pl-7 border-l-2 border-accent/30 ml-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-1","children":"Fix"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6","children":"Load the page on a 390px device (or Chrome DevTools device toolbar at 390px) and record a screenshot of the initial viewport. The primary CTA must be visible without scrolling. If it is not, restructure the hero to place the button above any image, subheadline, or proof element."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 